Description: Cross-platform Qt 6 companion for 0xFEEA BLE smartwatches
 FitLink connects over Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) to compatible 0xFEEA
 protocol smartwatches (V1 and V2 framing) to synchronize system time,
 mirror Linux D-Bus desktop notifications, send custom and scheduled alerts,
 monitor battery and firmware metadata, and trigger Find Watch alerts.
